## IMPORTANT LESSONS FROM THIS SESSION

1. **Vercel framework detection:** First deploy had no Next.js code, so Vercel detected wrong framework. Had to manually change Framework Preset to "Next.js" in Settings → General and redeploy. If deployment looks green but shows 404, check framework settings.

2. **Encoding:** Em dashes in source files can render as `â€"` if encoding is wrong. Use HTML entity `&mdash;` instead.

3. **Notion integration works:** Claude Code can read/write to Notion tracker via MCP. "Comments" column was added for per-task context (URLs, decisions, flags).

4. **Windows path spaces:** Harmless "Permission denied" warnings in bash due to spaces in Windows username path. Git operations still complete successfully (exit code 0).

